{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29148","headline":"元处士自洛归宛陵山居见示詹事相公饯行之什因赠 · 许浑","name":"元处士自洛归宛陵山居见示詹事相公饯行之什因赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫霄峰下绝韦编，旧隐相如结韈前。\n月落尚留东合醉，风高还忆北窗眠。\n江城夜别潇潇雨，山槛晴归漠漠烟。\n一顷豆花三顷竹，想应抛却钓鱼船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}